1
00:00:05,506 --> 00:00:08,092
What matters is
whether I'm alive.

2
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:12,805
And to be alive means
to eat others!

3
00:00:14,265 --> 00:00:15,808
We all eat to live.

4
00:00:16,851 --> 00:00:18,602
We're all the same.

5
00:00:18,978 --> 00:00:20,521
All of us.

6
00:00:20,855 --> 00:00:24,984
<i>Now you know the urgency of</i>
<i>the situation.</i>

7
00:00:25,693 --> 00:00:30,448
<i>There are 4,000 of those Amazons</i>
<i>across the city!</i>

8
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:42,835
"Nozama Pharmaceutical Lab"

9
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:16,744
Don't forget the MRI and the skin sample.

10
00:01:17,328 --> 00:01:19,830
Forward the belt to the tech unit.

11
00:01:19,914 --> 00:01:20,831
Yes.

12
00:01:26,587 --> 00:01:29,089
Mr. Tachibana requested to see

13
00:01:29,256 --> 00:01:33,844
the data we collected
from the belt and Amazon cells.

14
00:01:35,095 --> 00:01:40,559
He said his marketing team needs
it to recoup our costs.

15
00:01:40,768 --> 00:01:42,770
That's creative.

16
00:01:43,229 --> 00:01:49,527
He still thinks the uncontrollable
test subjects will be profitable.

17
00:01:49,610 --> 00:01:51,904
With the belt, they will.

18
00:01:52,947 --> 00:01:57,076
The belt enhances
an Amazon's combat skills.

19
00:01:57,284 --> 00:01:58,285
<i>Omega.</i>

20
00:02:06,085 --> 00:02:11,632
Combat skills... So he wants to sell
them as weapons.

21
00:02:11,924 --> 00:02:12,967
I see.

22
00:02:13,092 --> 00:02:16,887
Amazon cells have
much greater possibilities.

23
00:02:17,137 --> 00:02:18,013
Oh?

24
00:02:18,722 --> 00:02:21,475
I see it in Jin Takayama.

25
00:02:25,646 --> 00:02:27,147
And in Haruka.

26
00:02:30,109 --> 00:02:31,443
Any word?

27
00:02:32,653 --> 00:02:35,614
I told the Exterminators to
return him.

28
00:02:36,782 --> 00:02:42,288
But he may not be so compliant
this time.

29
00:02:42,621 --> 00:02:43,956
Don't worry.

30
00:02:44,456 --> 00:02:48,919
He needs us to make decisions
for him.

31
00:02:49,128 --> 00:02:51,255
He's like a toddler.

32
00:03:08,105 --> 00:03:08,772
It's hot!

33
00:03:16,697 --> 00:03:22,620
That kid, Haruka is still down
by the river, is that OK?

34
00:03:23,329 --> 00:03:26,665
Is he? I told him to go home.

35
00:03:26,790 --> 00:03:32,129
Maybe he's lost. If he
doesn't get home to his mommy

36
00:03:32,838 --> 00:03:35,215
the Director won't like it.

37
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:39,845
Oh, Jesus.

38
00:03:55,361 --> 00:03:59,865
We'd be better off with
that green Amazon.

39
00:04:00,032 --> 00:04:05,162
Yeah but Shido really wants to
return him.

40
00:04:05,287 --> 00:04:06,413
Why?

41
00:04:07,164 --> 00:04:07,956
Dunno.

42
00:04:08,332 --> 00:04:10,125
Thinks he's a risk.

43
00:04:15,798 --> 00:04:17,007
So he said.

44
00:04:21,178 --> 00:04:22,012
Well...

45
00:04:23,722 --> 00:04:25,516
he is an Amazon.

46
00:04:44,785 --> 00:04:47,287
<i>If I go back to Mother...</i>

47
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:52,751
<i>It means going back</i>
<i>to that room.</i>

48
00:04:56,255 --> 00:04:57,881
<i>It means...</i>

49
00:05:09,309 --> 00:05:10,269
Hey.

50
00:05:18,277 --> 00:05:21,530
Why are you here? Go home.

51
00:05:23,365 --> 00:05:24,241
Yeah.

52
00:05:28,537 --> 00:05:32,458
Go on home. So the Director
is your mom?

53
00:05:33,083 --> 00:05:34,084
I was adopted.

54
00:05:36,628 --> 00:05:40,424
Is Mamoru OK?

55
00:05:41,425 --> 00:05:44,094
Yes. He's being treated at the Lab.

56
00:05:44,178 --> 00:05:49,183
Mamoru! Have some snacks, boy!

57
00:05:50,267 --> 00:05:52,603
No injection today.

58
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,647
Mamoru, listen!

59
00:05:55,814 --> 00:05:59,318
You can join the team
when you're better.

60
00:06:00,652 --> 00:06:02,738
Don't cry, Mamoru!

61
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:04,531
How about Jin?

62
00:06:05,866 --> 00:06:10,037
They want his data.
I don't think he'll be killed.

63
00:06:10,329 --> 00:06:12,331
I see...

64
00:06:12,539 --> 00:06:14,208
Now go home.

65
00:06:14,416 --> 00:06:16,210
Tell me why...

66
00:06:17,127 --> 00:06:18,086
What?

67
00:06:18,629 --> 00:06:21,673
You want to kick me out.

68
00:06:25,969 --> 00:06:28,305
Is it because I'm an Amazon?

69
00:06:28,722 --> 00:06:33,477
So is Mamoru but
you let him join you.

70
00:06:37,105 --> 00:06:38,524
You want to stay?

71
00:06:40,359 --> 00:06:41,360
Huh?

72
00:06:41,652 --> 00:06:45,572
Why do you want to hunt bugs
with us?

73
00:06:47,741 --> 00:06:49,159
Well...

74
00:06:50,536 --> 00:06:54,706
Mamoru loves the team and food.

75
00:06:55,082 --> 00:06:58,877
The others risk their lives
for money.

76
00:06:59,253 --> 00:07:01,255
Their motives are simple.

77
00:07:02,714 --> 00:07:05,467
That's why I can trust them.

78
00:07:07,344 --> 00:07:09,763
You don't know why you fight.

79
00:07:10,264 --> 00:07:12,808
That puts my life on the line.

80
00:07:19,064 --> 00:07:20,274
Go home.

81
00:07:21,358 --> 00:07:23,652
You'll just cause trouble.

82
00:07:27,239 --> 00:07:28,490
OK.

83
00:07:50,888 --> 00:07:53,223
He's like a regular kid...

84
00:08:17,748 --> 00:08:19,207
Haruka?

85
00:08:20,042 --> 00:08:20,876
Haruka!

86
00:08:22,711 --> 00:08:24,421
Hi, Mizuki.

87
00:08:25,088 --> 00:08:28,133
You're home! Are you OK?

88
00:08:28,842 --> 00:08:34,264
You were in hospital, right?
Mom said I couldn't visit.

89
00:08:35,223 --> 00:08:36,433
Oh...

90
00:08:37,142 --> 00:08:40,479
<i>So that's how she explained it.</i>

91
00:08:41,146 --> 00:08:44,608
I guess you need time to recover.

92
00:08:45,275 --> 00:08:47,611
I'm fine!

93
00:08:49,404 --> 00:08:52,157
I'm so glad you
weren't gone long.

94
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:56,620
I wasn't sure how to
take care of them.

95
00:08:56,954 --> 00:08:59,915
You fed them? Thank you.

96
00:09:17,432 --> 00:09:22,270
Remember you said this room
was like your aquarium?

97
00:09:25,983 --> 00:09:27,985
I feel the same.

98
00:09:32,447 --> 00:09:34,491
I'm glad you're back.

99
00:09:46,044 --> 00:09:47,671
I was wrong...

100
00:09:50,924 --> 00:09:52,718
to come back.

101
00:09:54,011 --> 00:09:54,970
What?

102
00:10:05,772 --> 00:10:07,065
Haruka...

103
00:10:09,609 --> 00:10:12,404
Haruka, what's going on?

104
00:10:15,449 --> 00:10:18,285
Where are you going on that thing?

105
00:10:22,414 --> 00:10:26,043
Sorry. Don't worry,
I'll be OK.

106
00:10:27,085 --> 00:10:27,753
But...

107
00:10:34,468 --> 00:10:35,594
Haruka!

108
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:42,017
What's got into him?

109
00:11:47,541 --> 00:11:50,710
Help me carry this in exchange
for food.

110
00:11:51,878 --> 00:11:53,338
Nanaha.

111
00:12:07,435 --> 00:12:10,647
So Jin's at Nozama Lab.

112
00:12:11,982 --> 00:12:16,403
For a checkup.
You don't have to worry.

113
00:12:16,778 --> 00:12:19,364
Can you pass me the plates?

114
00:12:20,532 --> 00:12:26,371
So the Exterminators kicked you out
and you didn't want to go home?

115
00:12:27,205 --> 00:12:31,877
It's not like that.
It just felt wrong.

116
00:12:34,045 --> 00:12:39,217
You can never tame a wild beast.

117
00:12:40,051 --> 00:12:42,762
Even if you were a very obedient pet.

118
00:12:48,518 --> 00:12:50,770
Everybody says the same...

119
00:12:51,730 --> 00:12:56,067
All I wanted to know was if
I'm a human or not.

120
00:12:57,402 --> 00:13:01,990
Jin and Shido don't think I am.
Nor do I.

121
00:13:07,370 --> 00:13:09,331
But the more I fought...

122
00:13:21,134 --> 00:13:23,220
...the better I felt!

123
00:13:26,765 --> 00:13:32,103
Is that the real me
or someone inside me?

124
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:35,482
I don't know...

125
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:42,906
Then ask yourself
what you want to do.

126
00:13:43,448 --> 00:13:46,785
You'd better eat and
get some sleep.

127
00:14:44,175 --> 00:14:47,846
<i>Something must have</i>
<i>happened to Haruka.</i>

128
00:15:09,784 --> 00:15:14,664
<i>I'll visit the Lab tomorrow.</i>
<i>He might be there.</i>

129
00:15:40,148 --> 00:15:41,900
Departing....

130
00:16:50,343 --> 00:16:52,345
I sense something...

131
00:17:06,943 --> 00:17:08,361
Exterminators.

132
00:17:08,486 --> 00:17:09,571
<i>There's a bug.</i>

133
00:17:26,629 --> 00:17:29,132
Exterminators in action.

134
00:17:29,299 --> 00:17:32,302
<i>Sir, we lost the ID signal.</i>

135
00:17:39,684 --> 00:17:41,519
Was it a mistake?

136
00:17:41,644 --> 00:17:47,650
<i>We detected this signal at the same</i>
<i>location once before but lost it.</i>

137
00:17:47,984 --> 00:17:50,570
<i>We thought it was an error.</i>

138
00:17:51,362 --> 00:17:53,364
What do you mean?

139
00:17:53,490 --> 00:17:57,160
<i>It was in a tunnel so that</i>
<i>affects the signal.</i>

140
00:17:59,412 --> 00:18:01,831
It's a "B" rank...

141
00:18:02,582 --> 00:18:08,129
Maybe it's risky without Mamoru
and the green Amazon?

142
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:12,634
But this sissy saw the green Amazon
as a risk!

143
00:18:12,759 --> 00:18:14,093
Lay off!

144
00:18:14,969 --> 00:18:17,430
Fuku, take us to the site.

145
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:35,698
I can sense it. There's an Amazon.

146
00:18:53,424 --> 00:18:55,176
What's he up to?

147
00:18:57,387 --> 00:18:58,388
Go.

148
00:19:32,338 --> 00:19:33,214
Hey.

149
00:19:33,339 --> 00:19:36,801
Shido, I think the driver
is a Subject.

150
00:19:41,222 --> 00:19:42,056
You.

151
00:19:42,932 --> 00:19:44,892
Can you step out?

152
00:19:47,145 --> 00:19:48,813
Can you hear us?

153
00:19:50,773 --> 00:19:51,816
Nozomi.

154
00:19:58,781 --> 00:20:04,787
Hello everyone! There might be
something hazardous onboard.

155
00:20:04,912 --> 00:20:09,167
If you could please
get out immediately.

156
00:20:09,292 --> 00:20:11,502
Watch your step.

157
00:20:12,211 --> 00:20:14,297
Go on!

158
00:20:17,342 --> 00:20:19,385
You too!

159
00:20:19,719 --> 00:20:22,180
Say something.

160
00:20:41,032 --> 00:20:42,408
Amazon!

161
00:20:44,077 --> 00:20:45,453
<i>Omega.</i>

162
00:20:56,381 --> 00:20:58,424
Hey, wait!

163
00:20:59,384 --> 00:21:00,802
What about me...?

164
00:21:12,897 --> 00:21:14,732
What are you doing?

165
00:21:20,196 --> 00:21:20,947
Stop!

166
00:21:59,819 --> 00:22:00,862
You!

167
00:22:03,364 --> 00:22:06,868
Shido, he has an armlet!
He's a Subject.

168
00:22:38,649 --> 00:22:40,693
How dare you interfere!

169
00:22:41,444 --> 00:22:44,155
I was so close...!

170
00:23:25,863 --> 00:23:27,865
Cover the green Amazon.

171
00:23:53,933 --> 00:23:55,059
Where to?

172
00:23:55,184 --> 00:23:58,271
Nozama Pharmaceutical Lab.

173
00:24:40,104 --> 00:24:41,272
This is Shido!

174
00:24:43,316 --> 00:24:46,110
We're fighting a bug now!

175
00:24:46,235 --> 00:24:51,157
<i>But there's another faint</i>
<i>signal in the tunnel...</i>

176
00:24:51,282 --> 00:24:52,658
What...?

177
00:24:57,747 --> 00:24:58,748
It makes no sense.

178
00:25:06,714 --> 00:25:10,426
Maybe I should just go home.

179
00:26:07,274 --> 00:26:08,526
It's <i>blue</i>.

180
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:14,615
No way...

181
00:26:14,782 --> 00:26:18,119
That means it wasn't fully awakened!

182
00:26:19,161 --> 00:26:21,163
It wasn't his signal?

183
00:26:22,081 --> 00:26:24,750
<i>Shido, there's a bug in the tunnel!</i>

184
00:27:07,126 --> 00:27:09,879
Get out and run!

185
00:27:26,687 --> 00:27:27,480
Mizuki!

186
00:27:30,399 --> 00:27:31,317
Fuku!

187
00:27:57,968 --> 00:27:59,178
Holy shit!

188
00:27:59,345 --> 00:28:05,309
The Subject we killed must have
fed passengers to this one.

189
00:28:05,434 --> 00:28:06,477
No way!

190
00:28:06,852 --> 00:28:07,978
<i>Mizuki...</i>

191
00:28:14,235 --> 00:28:15,236
Jin...

192
00:28:27,623 --> 00:28:29,542
Confine him and

193
00:28:29,667 --> 00:28:31,377
control his diet.

194
00:28:31,544 --> 00:28:32,711
Yes, ma'am.

195
00:28:52,398 --> 00:28:54,233
Mizuki!

196
00:29:18,799 --> 00:29:21,802
I chose to be an Amazon.

197
00:29:22,011 --> 00:29:24,972
When I'm an Amazon, I lose myself!

198
00:29:25,264 --> 00:29:26,265
Haruka...

199
00:29:26,432 --> 00:29:29,268
I can't fight with a guy
I don't trust.

200
00:29:29,393 --> 00:29:32,313
I'll join you and hunt the bugs!
